{"steam_appid":4834070,"steam_name":"Don't Sleep With The Fishes","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4834070/1366596017/e7ed1bad2a12c3b92051ba9fcb75569752a957e4/1781338895/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1781339798","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257357772/07ede045f97d059c88aa7e0376e1196473873c36/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1781339798","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4834070/8587f0ab97b9ae3dc2fb8695d9aca7b06669cc60/ss_8587f0ab97b9ae3dc2fb8695d9aca7b06669cc60.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782468658","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4834070/8c9232fdf8a5c043e4803b214561e819c9f0f0be/ss_8c9232fdf8a5c043e4803b214561e819c9f0f0be.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782468658","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4834070/41ab94b094d1b25cad2ade59029b50d01076add0/ss_41ab94b094d1b25cad2ade59029b50d01076add0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782468658","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4834070/d98c933a9ad84d3b17eb586d0a7d363775524a2a/ss_d98c933a9ad84d3b17eb586d0a7d363775524a2a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782468658","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4834070/9a850ca146f99c5a782827d634f3d1f740b0e1b9/ss_9a850ca146f99c5a782827d634f3d1f740b0e1b9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782468658"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>'Don't Sleep With The Fishes'</i></strong><i> is a point-and-click survival horror game focused on rapid salvaging, resource management, and surviving day by day at sea featuring:</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized</strong> scavenging and events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Different <strong>shipmates</strong> to take with you and talk to.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cozy</strong> and <strong>creepy</strong> atmosphere that alternates between day and night. <i>(This game contains Jumpscares!)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4834070/extras/f4b624a0d140cea31fe266fc5e85c54c.avif?t=1782468658\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4834070/extras_big/f4b624a0d140cea31fe266fc5e85c54c.webp?t=1782468658 width=1560 height=243 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>How To Play:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re the <strong>captain</strong> of a ship on a covert delivery mission with a small crew. Without warning, something strikes the vessel, causing severe damage. You wait for the emergency horns. When they sound, you know you need to evacuate immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4834070/extras/b65b93df1bf498a032c16164e1282574.poster.avif?t=1782468658\" width=800 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4834070/extras/b65b93df1bf498a032c16164e1282574.webm?t=1782468658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4834070/extras/b65b93df1bf498a032c16164e1282574.mp4?t=1782468658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is running out! <strong>Gather</strong> whatever you can and toss it into your <strong>lifeboat</strong>, before the ship sinks. Every <strong>item</strong> counts! <strong>Escape</strong> by staying near the boat at the end! However, it can only carry <strong>one</strong> <strong>more</strong> <strong>person</strong> besides you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4834070/extras/ebbe78bd8d6fbc86a51614906622ae97.poster.avif?t=1782468658\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4834070/extras/ebbe78bd8d6fbc86a51614906622ae97.webm?t=1782468658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4834070/extras/ebbe78bd8d6fbc86a51614906622ae97.mp4?t=1782468658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the daytime to spend your <strong>energy</strong> on <strong>fishing</strong>, eating, doing small tasks, or chatting to your <strong>shipmate</strong> (if you brought one). When you run out of energy, <strong>end</strong> <strong>the</strong> <strong>day</strong> and try to <strong>sleep</strong> hoping nothing disrupts your rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4834070/extras/b22d56a786e8bb9306686050e1a70bb9.poster.avif?t=1782468658\" width=800 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4834070/extras/b22d56a786e8bb9306686050e1a70bb9.webm?t=1782468658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4834070/extras/b22d56a786e8bb9306686050e1a70bb9.mp4?t=1782468658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your night does get interrupted, use an <strong>item</strong> you brought to handle the situation. If you have no answer, you can try going back to <strong>sleep</strong>. Sometimes, that’s your only option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your adventure could end in many ways. In some, you will survive. In most, you won't.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4834070/extras/0b252f1b48e21768f68c6caf383120b2.avif?t=1782468658\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4834070/extras_big/0b252f1b48e21768f68c6caf383120b2.webp?t=1782468658 width=1560 height=243 /></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon R7 265 / Intel UHD 620<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible sound card</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible sound card</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Taiki"],"publishers":["DopplerGhost"],"release_date":"Jun 26, 2026"}